    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.poster.avif?t=1755098750\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.webm?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/db500175ec90b6b1d4a8b6ebc9a6c61c.mp4?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The killer is hiding among the passengers on the Fatal Train. <strong>Four detectives</strong> have taken on this challenging case. But honestly, does anyone care with everything else going on?<br><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/587d72c95574f3774559ec752744a701.poster.avif?t=1755098750\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/587d72c95574f3774559ec752744a701.webm?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/587d72c95574f3774559ec752744a701.mp4?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like a cup of coffee, or perhaps you prefer whiskey? On this train, you\u2019ll find exactly what you\u2019re looking for: casinos, bars, a library, and even some old terminals. But wait... it seems one of the passengers is missing! Oh no he's dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</span><br><strong>Detectives! let\u2019s get to work!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/9b536c0f036950bd399cf4dea7554f7f.poster.avif?t=1755098750\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/9b536c0f036950bd399cf4dea7554f7f.webm?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/9b536c0f036950bd399cf4dea7554f7f.mp4?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</span></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out more about the passengers! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through their belongings, open their briefcases, and watch their every move. Search the bodies for clues that might lead you to other,\u00a0<strong>then let your revolver teach some manners!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/4ba90fd4950c23224291537e7097df8d.poster.avif?t=1755098750\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/4ba90fd4950c23224291537e7097df8d.webm?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/4ba90fd4950c23224291537e7097df8d.mp4?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</span></strong><br>Good luck, detectives. The entire train is counting on you. And remember, at any moment, the train could catch fire, be struck by lightning, or be haunted by ghosts! But I have no doubt that our <strong>brave detectives</strong> will survive this crazy ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</strong></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game in active development, wishlist and follow game to see more!</u></strong></p>",
