item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/4ba90fd4950c23224291537e7097df8d.poster.avif?t=1755098750\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/4ba90fd4950c23224291537e7097df8d.webm?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193920/extras/4ba90fd4950c23224291537e7097df8d.mp4?t=1755098750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</span></strong><br>Good luck, detectives. The entire train is counting on you. And remember, at any moment, the train could catch fire, be struck by lightning, or be haunted by ghosts! But I have no doubt that our <strong>brave detectives</strong> will survive this crazy ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164</strong></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game in active development, wishlist and follow game to see more!</u></strong></p>",
